<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[SelectBox] 속성을 사용하여 전체 항목 표시하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_99a42241bbcd8b25" class="chapter_title">[SelectBox] 속성을 사용하여 전체 항목 표시하기</h1><h1 id="r_61e8c316c0bb0d0e" class="element heading1" data-element-id="61e8c316c0bb0d0e"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_0ca528aec3a47776" class="element pre" data-element-id="0ca528aec3a47776">SelectBox의 'allOption' 속성을 사용하여 '전체' 항목을 표시한 예제입니다.
항목의 'label'은 '-전체-'이고, 'value'는 'all'입니다.</pre><p id="r_424e18903dd54b65" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="424e18903dd54b65"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00339">P00339</a></p><h1 id="r_572ccf280a039eda" class="element heading1" data-element-id="572ccf280a039eda"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_899105fd54e96287" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="899105fd54e96287"><li><p>SelectBox의 전체 항목 표시하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_e719d8a78834f053" class="element heading1" data-element-id="e719d8a78834f053"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_a9c4855c1a129c43" class="element heading2" data-element-id="a9c4855c1a129c43"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>전체 항목 표시하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_6b504edc86ffd878" class="element step1" data-element-id="6b504edc86ffd878"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>컴포넌트의 항목을 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_f274bbef6c1da9fc" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="f274bbef6c1da9fc">항목의 최상단에 '전체' 항목이 표시됩니다. 항목의 문자열을 '-전체-'로 표시됩니다.</p><div id="r_7a933d2ae5f7363d" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="7a933d2ae5f7363d"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1360.png" width="151" height="128" /></p></div><p id="r_8e78ccb748a44a28" class="element normal renumbered step1_indent" data-element-id="8e78ccb748a44a28">컴포넌트의 오른쪽에 선택된 항목의 value가 표시됩니다. '전체' 항목은 'all'이 표시됩니다.</p><h1 id="r_f5e64ac8a5901e42" class="element heading1" data-element-id="f5e64ac8a5901e42"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_ff02d259850bd3eb" class="element heading2" data-element-id="ff02d259850bd3eb"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>전체 항목 표시하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_dda102beb3564493" class="element step1" data-element-id="dda102beb3564493"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>'allOption' 속성을 'true'로 설정합니다.</p></div><ul id="r_540d133a9b310cb9" class="element unordered_list step1_indent" data-element-id="540d133a9b310cb9"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] allOption="true"</span> </p><p>[default: false, true] 전체 항목의 표시 여부를 설정합니다.</p></li></ul><div id="r_a97e82105d6bd742" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="a97e82105d6bd742"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View - 속성 설정 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1361.png" width="314" height="136" /></p></div><div id="r_1e5b4d1221b859b2" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="1e5b4d1221b859b2"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;xf:select1 <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">allOption</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"true"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>    <span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/xf:select1&gt;</pre></div><h1 id="r_01448f0d57e1d578" class="element heading1" data-element-id="01448f0d57e1d578"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_63c7288fda924480" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="63c7288fda924480"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">allOption</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>